chars()
mapToInt                                    //returntype: OptionalInt  //fetch: getAsInt
IntStream.range()/IntStream.rangeClosed

difference between range and rangeClosed

range
->end exclusive
->e.g: IntStream.range(1, 5)          //1 2 3 4

rangeClosed
->end inclusive
->e.g: IntStream.rangeClosed(1, 5)    //1 2 3 4 5

difference between map & mapToObj
map
->used on object streams
->ex: Stream<String>, Stream<Integer>

mapToObj
->used on primitive streams
->ex: IntStream, LongStream

